<title>ITALY: Italy cabinet approves Autostrade sell-off bill.</title>
<headline>Italy cabinet approves Autostrade sell-off bill.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian cabinet has approved a decree which establishes the procedures for the privatisation of motorway operator, cabinet secretary Enrico Micheli told a news conference on Friday.</p>
<p>The bill allows for the sale of Autrostrade through a public sale offer (OPV) and private negotiation.</p>
<p>Autostrade is due to be sold off by the summer and earlier this week Banca Commerciale Italiana and Sbc Warburg were appointed joint-global coordinators for the sale. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
